  "text": "on the myth of market \"short-termism\" (Mauboussin, CSFB, 1997)\n\n\"The next myth is that the market is very short-term orientated. This one is a favorite of the business press, and is a theory in which many CEOs indulge.\"\n\n\"It is a canard is that the market is 'unsophisticated' or in some instances 'irrational'...Collectively, the market gets it a lot more times than it doesn’t get it.\"\n\nhttps://t.co/NJGD1BMVcX",
